Notebook[{Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["bandplot", "ObjectName"],
     Cell[TextData[{Cell["   ", "ModInfo"], Cell[BoxData["bandplot[path, n, ham, rules]"], "InlineFormula"], "  ",
        "应用参数规则后，沿带标签的倒易分数坐标路径绘制 ham 的数值本征值。"}], "Usage"],
     Cell[
      "每段路径的格式为 {{k1, k2}, {label1, label2}}，两个动量点均包含三个倒易分数坐标。",
      "Notes"],
     Cell[
      "n 是每段路径的细分数，因此每段包含 n + 1 个采样点。动量坐标乘以 2 Pi 后再代入 ham。"\
, "Notes"], Cell["rules 必须为 ham 中的每个自由参数提供数值。", "Notes"],
     Cell["相邻两段路径不连续时，边界刻度会按 end|start 合并两个标签。", "Notes"],
     Cell[
      "结果为带边框的 Graphics 对象。路径、采样数、参数规则、刻度、字体设置无效或哈密顿量不能数值化时，会返回 $Failed 并给出消息。"\
, "Notes"], Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{{Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon"], "\"PlotRange\"", "All",
          Cell["设置显示的能量范围。", "TableText"]}, {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon"], "\"YTicks\"",
          "Automatic", Cell["将纵轴边框刻度设置为 Automatic、None、数值位置或标准刻度规格。",
           "TableText"]}, {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon"], "FontSize", "24",
          Cell["设置路径标签和边框刻度的字号。", "TableText"]}, {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon"],
          "FontFamily", "\"Times\"", Cell["设置路径标签和边框刻度的字体。", "TableText"]},
         {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon"], "ImageSize", "Automatic", Cell["设置最终 Graphics 的图像尺寸。",
           "TableText"]}}, GridBoxAlignment -> {"Columns" -> {{Left}}}]], "3ColumnTableMod"]}, Open]],
  Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["范例初始化", "ExamplesInitializationSection"],
     Cell[BoxData["Needs[\"MagneticKP`\"]"], "ExampleInitialization"]}, Open]],
  Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["基本范例", "PrimaryExamplesSection"],
     Cell["使用 kpHam 构造一阶双带哈密顿量，并为每个模型参数指定数值：", "ExampleText"],
     Cell[BoxData["input = <|\n  \"Unitary\" -> <|\n    \"C2z\" -> {\n      {{0, 1}, {-1, 0}},\n      {-kx, -ky, kz}\n  \
  },\n    \"Inversion\" -> {\n      {{1, 0}, {0, -1}},\n      {-kx, -ky, -kz}\n    }\n  |>\n|>;\nham = kpHam[1, \
input][\"ham\"];\nparams = Complement[Variables[ham], {kx, ky, kz}];\nrules = Thread[params -> \
N[Range[Length[params]]/5]];\npath = {\n  {{{0, 0, 0}, {1/3, 0, 0}}, {\"G\", \"X\"}},\n  {{{1/3, 0, 0}, {1/3, 1/3, 0}}, \
{\"X\", \"M\"}}\n};\n{Dimensions[ham], rules}"], "Input"],
     Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"2", ",", "2"}], "}"}], ",",
